# Project GOALs

> Active GOAL의 ID는 `.harness/progress.json.goals.active_id` 와 일치해야 한다.

## (예시 양식 — 첫 발화 시 CEO가 채움)

```yaml
goals:
  - id: G-1
    title: <text>
    description: <text>
    success_metrics:
      - <명시적·측정 가능한 결과>
    deadline: <YYYY-MM-DD>
    kpis:
      - name: <metric_name>
        target: <value>
        direction: higher-is-better | lower-is-better
        weight: 0.0-1.0
    runbook: startup-mvp | enterprise-feature | marketing | incident
    owner_confirmed: false
    cto_feasibility: feasible | feasible-with-recruit | infeasible
    cto_notes: <text>
    status: draft | active | achieved | abandoned
```

